	"data": "Neurosity Notion (BCI Device)\n\nWhat It Is\nA brain-computer interface (BCI) device from Neurosity — cithoreal researched and apparently owned/used the Notion 1 device in early 2025. The Notion series uses EEG sensors for cognitive state monitoring.\n\nDevice Specs (Notion 1)\n8-channel EEG sensors (temporal and frontal regions)\n250Hz sampling rate\n25 samples per epoch\nConnects via Bluetooth + Wi-Fi\n\nUse Case\nNeurosity devices read brainwaves to monitor mental states (focus, calm, cognitive load).…",
